@startuml 03-implantacao
title OrbitaPay — Implantação (docker compose · rede orbita 172.30.0.0/24)

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"

node "Dispositivo do usuário" {
  artifact "App Expo" as app
  artifact "Navegador" as nav
}

node "Host Docker · rede orbita" {
  node "gateway\n172.30.0.90:9000" as gw <<container>>
  note right of gw : exposto em localhost:**9000**

  node "auth\n172.30.0.91:9001" as aut <<container>>
  node "clientes\n172.30.0.92:9002" as cli <<container>>
  node "ativos\n172.30.0.93:9003" as atv <<container>>
  node "negociacao\n172.30.0.94:9004" as neg <<container>>
  node "pagamentos\n172.30.0.95:9005" as pag <<container>>

  node "rabbitmq\n172.30.0.10" as mq <<container>>
  note right of mq : localhost:**5672** (AMQP)\nlocalhost:**15672** (painel)

  database "mongo-auth\n172.30.0.191" as mauth
  database "mongo-clientes\n172.30.0.192" as mcli
  database "mongo-ativos\n172.30.0.193" as matv
  database "mongo-negociacao\n172.30.0.194" as mneg
  database "mongo-pagamentos\n172.30.0.195" as mpag
}

app --> gw
nav --> gw
gw --> aut
gw --> cli
gw --> atv
gw --> neg
gw --> pag

aut --> mauth
cli --> mcli
atv --> matv
neg --> mneg
pag --> mpag

aut --> mq
cli --> mq
neg --> mq
pag --> mq

note bottom of mcli
  cada MongoDB roda como replica set (rs0)
  para permitir transações
end note
@enduml
